### GET Reviews

GET {{base_url}}/my-reviews/ HTTP/1.1
Consent-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Retrive User Review

GET {{base_url}}/my-reviews/2/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### DELETE User Review

DELETE {{base_url}}/my-reviews/1/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### PATCH User Review

PATCH {{base_url}}/my-reviews/2/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ratings": 3,
  "tags": [
    2,
    3,
    6
  ]
}


### POST User Review

POST {{base_url}}/my-reviews/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ratings": 3,
  "tags": [
    2,
    3,
    6
  ]
}
